 Pei Jun to Shu and rose to become an Overseeing General of Shu Han. Following the fall of Shu Han, he returned to Luoyang and was appointed Gentleman Consultant.","jp":"蜀・晋の武将。裴儁の子で、曹魏の尚書令・裴潜の甥。河東裴氏の出身。父の裴儁に従って入蜀し、官位は蜀漢の督軍に至った。蜀漢滅亡後は洛陽に移り、議郎に任じられた。","kr":"촉과 진의 무장으로 배준의 아들이자 조위 상서령 배잠의 조카이다. 하동 배씨 출신으로 아버지 배준을 따라 촉에 들어갔으며, 관직은 촉한의 독군에 이르렀다. 촉한이 멸망한 후 낙양으로 돌아와 의랑에 임명되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1039815","remark":"","surname":"裴","surnameTc":"裴","surnameEn":"Pei","surnameJp":"裴","surnameKr":"배","surnameOther":"","name":"越","nameTc":"越","nameEn":"Yue","nameJp":"越","nameKr":"월","nameOther":"","word":"令绪","wordTc":"令緒","wordEn":"Lingxu","wordJp":"令緒","wordKr":"영서","wordOther":"","icon":"裴越","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"217","city":"CS1039","gender":"0","rule":"32","force":"24","wise":"67","politics":"68","charm":"70","will":"78","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"5","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"14/13/14/11/11/67/11/11","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4400","battleSoulPoint":"1500","debateSoulPoint":"6500","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000805","professions":"1/1/0/0/0/0/1/0/2/2/1/2/1/2/0/1/2/1/1/2/0/1/2/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"55","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"1000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"200","show":"214","death":"284","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1024905","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;2/1;3/1;58/1;16/1;24/1;2